# Claim Jumper: the condition is an intervening "if" (CR 603.4): it must hold when the ability would trigger and again as it
# resolves. On turn 5 Bot2 has two lands to Bot1's one, so casting it triggers it; with the trigger on the stack Bot2
# sacrifices Strip Mine to destroy its own Island, leaving none to Bot1's one, and Bot1 is never asked to search.

